{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>But on Mount Zion</b> — All the nations shall be as though they were not, and there will be no remnant for them, but on Mount Zion there shall be remnant. Yefet said: This is for the future. Rabbi Moses said: In the days of Hezekiah. And Rabbi Yeshuah said: In the Second Temple period."], :book :obadiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Obadiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=18&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:34.729855189Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}